            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Cripes typo's. - I can see where i got 'mini.nvim' from now as I was on the main mini repo page for a while.\n\nYour explanation for the other Mini* is something I hadn't figured out yet :).\n\nWhen I setup in my nvim config folder  `lua/custom/plugsin/neovim.lua`\nWhich gets pulled in by the main \"init.lua\" which is basically `kickstart.nvim`.\nWith the following content it does not work \n```lua\nreturn { 'echasnovski/mini.files', version = '*', }\n```\n\nIt does work with `opts = {}` added\n\nI raised my issue as  I thought the fix was only to change the doc to add `opts = {}` under the section for \"With folke/lazy.nvim\"\n\n",
