            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> It does work with opts = {} added\n\nThat is to be expected when using `echasnovski/mini.files` instead of `echasnovski/mini.nvim`. See the [lazy.nvim](https://lazy.folke.io/spec#spec-setup) documentation. Without either `opts` or `config`, the setup function of the plugin will not be invoked.",
